          {
            "id": 706,
            "title": "Questions 15-20",
            "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Which event in the history of football in the UK took place in each of the following years? Choose the correct answer and move into the gap</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</div>",
